  <sect2 role="package">
    <title>Introduction to Kdenlive</title>

    <para>
      The <application>Kdenlive</application> package is a KF6 based video editor.
    </para>

    &lfs124_checked;

    <bridgehead renderas="sect3">Package Information</bridgehead>
    <itemizedlist spacing="compact">
      <listitem>
        <para>
          Download (HTTP): <ulink url="&kdenlive-download-http;"/>
        </para>
      </listitem>
      <listitem>
        <para>
          Download (FTP): <ulink url="&kdenlive-download-ftp;"/>
        </para>
      </listitem>
      <listitem>
        <para>
          Download MD5 sum: &kdenlive-md5sum;
        </para>
      </listitem>
      <listitem>
        <para>
          Download size: &kdenlive-size;
        </para>
      </listitem>
      <listitem>
        <para>
          Estimated disk space required: &kdenlive-buildsize;
        </para>
      </listitem>
      <listitem>
        <para>
          Estimated build time: &kdenlive-time;
        </para>
      </listitem>
    </itemizedlist>

    <bridgehead renderas="sect3">Kdenlive Dependencies</bridgehead>

    <bridgehead renderas="sect4">Required</bridgehead>
    <para role="required">
      <xref linkend="git"/>, <xref linkend="kf6-frameworks"/>, <xref
linkend="mlt"/>, and <xref role="runtime" linkend="v4l-utils"/> (runtime)
    </para>

    <bridgehead renderas="sect4">Recommended</bridgehead>
    <para role="recommended">
      <xref linkend="breeze-icons"/>
    </para>

    <bridgehead renderas="sect4">Optional</bridgehead>
    <para role="optional">
      <ulink
url="https://glfs-book.github.io/slfs/general/ladspa-sdk.html">LADSPA-SDK</ulink>
and <ulink
url="https://glfs-book.github.io/slfs/general/noise-suppression.html">Noise-Suppression</ulink>
    </para>

    &build-use-internet;

  </sect2>

  <sect2 role="installation">
    <title>Installation of Kdenlive</title>

    <para>
      Install <application>Kdenlive</application> by running the following
commands:
    </para>

<screen><userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;
cd    build &amp;&amp;

cmake -D CMAKE_INSTALL_PREFIX=$KF6_PREFIX \
      -D CMAKE_BUILD_TYPE=Release         \
      -D BUILD_TESTING=OFF                \
      -W no-dev .. &amp;&amp;
make</userinput></screen>

    <note><para>
      The build process will download a Git repository of
<application>OpenTimelineIO</application>, totaling around 100
MB. Configuration will seem to hang right after <command>cmake</command>
begins running. This is normal, it is fetching that Git repository. If it
hangs for a while, it's most likely due to a poor download speed during the
download process.
    </para></note>

    <para>
      This package does not come with a test suite.
    </para>

    <para>
      Now, as the &root; user:
    </para>

<screen role="root"><userinput>make install</userinput></screen>

  </sect2>

